id: warped-evolution
name: Warped Evolution
uaType: magical
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic, Demon Clansmen Factor
tpCost: 20
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerBaseTier: 8
requiresTarget: true
# "You can only use the Warped Evolution Unique Ability once per Combat Encounter."
usageLimit: 1/encounter
# "Target an Ally. Make a Clash (Cognitive) against that Ally. If you win, halve that Ally's current Life Points, but they
# gain the Dark Evolution Awakening as a Level 2 Temporary Awakening" - the Life Points taken (rounded down), the
# Awakening said on the card: Awakenings are not in the system yet (chat.mjs postWarpedEvolution).
warpedEvolution: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Once an Encounter, a Clash (Cognitive) against an Ally: won, their Life Points halved and the Dark Evolution Awakening
  theirs as a Level 2 Temporary Awakening.
text: >
  Warped Evolution: You twist and warp and contort someone into a monstrous, grotesque version of themself.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic, Demon Clansmen Factor
  –TP Cost: 20
  –KP Cost: 8(bT)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: Non-Minion
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Target an Ally. Make a Clash (Cognitive) against that Ally. If you win, halve that Ally’s current Life Points,
  but they gain the Dark Evolution Awakening as a Level 2 Temporary Awakening.

  You can only use the Warped Evolution Unique Ability once per Combat Encounter.
